  type                     : USER_RIGHTS_POLICY
  description              : "1.0229 - MSSRV - (L1) Ensure 'Create global objects' is set to 'Administrators, LOCAL SERVICE, NETWORK SERVICE, SERVICE'"
  info                     : "This policy setting determines whether users can create global objects that are available to all sessions."
  solution                 : "To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to Administrators, LOCAL SERVICE, NETWORK SERVICE, SERVICE :

Computer Configuration\Policies\Windows Settings\Security Settings\Local Policies\User Rights Assignment\Create global objects

Impact:

None - this is the default behavior."
  reference                : "NIST 800-53r5|AC-2 AC-5 AC-6 AC-6(1) AC-6(7) AU-9(4)"
  see_also                 : "See HTH Policies and Standards"
  value_type               : USER_RIGHT
