  info                     : "This policy setting determines whether a domain member can periodically change its computer account password."
  solution                 : "To establish the recommended configuration via GP, set the following UI path to Disabled :

Computer Configuration\Policies\Windows Settings\Security Settings\Local Policies\Security Options\Domain member: Disable machine account password changes

Impact:

